 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How are you feeling?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.7,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm going on safari next month. What lens should I bring?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A telephoto zoom is the key one, something that reaches at least three hundred millimeters. Animals are often far away.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Those are heavy, right?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "They can be. Many safari vehicles have something to rest it on, and a small bean bag makes a great steady support.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I bring",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 3.35,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "a second camera body or is that overkill?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.24,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If you have one, it's handy. Changing lenses in dusty air can get dirt on the sensor, so two bodies saves a lot of hassle.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I only have one. I'll just be careful then.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That works. Change lenses inside the vehicle with the camera pointing down, and pack extra batteries and memory cards.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "photography.dlg3"
  }
 ]
}
